:: CatholicCW {"position":"450,50","size":"100,100"}
The main character of the game is a 3rd generation diaspora Puerto Rican who lives in a fictional Park Slope, New York and then migrated to a suburban unnamed part of New Jersey. A lot of Puerto Ricans are Catholic, so there will be mentions of saint statues, crosses, churches, and prayers. 

However, religion does not play a main role in this game and the character identifies as secular but culturally Catholic. Catholicism is a common motif in Latin American and Caribbean cultures. Even when the Latino is not neccessarily a church-going Catholic, they might be rocking that Mary tattoo because she is aesthetically cool to them.

[[Return->Epigram]] 

:: Epigram {"position":"300,50","size":"100,100"}
gothtangzhuang.space is a blog and email based horror interactive fiction about a friend/former lover gone missing. 

The narrator, Tai will be searching for him. It's your job to lead the way. 

Content Warning
- Catholicism mentions Please read further [[here.->CatholicCW]]
- Suicidal ideation, active and passive
- Self-harm mentions (burning, cutting)
- Alcohol use mentions
- Emotional and physical abuse by parents and partner
- Intimate partner violence (IPV)
- Sexual content

Gameplay
- Contains a lot of text
- A few puzzles
- Some graphics

[[Start->NarrativeIntro]]

:: Credits {"position":"25,25","size":"100,100"}
