:: DadDedication {"position":"2700,700","size":"100,100"}
This is kind of a weird game to dedicate to your Dad. Pieces of this game is based off histories I've read and never got a chance to ask him about. My father is the descendent of two Han Chinese, possibly both from the Shantou region, of Fujian/Teochew origin. They are Tan Peck Sim and Ng Liat Seng and they left China for Singapore during the Sino-Japanese Wars.  

Ng Liat Seng, my ah gong, was a coal merchant. Tan Peck Sim, with what little I know, is the birther and rearer of my baba and his 5 sisters. In the long house that the Ng family lived in with several others, they created their story. My baba lived through the economic expansions and post-British colonial conditions of Lee Kuan Yew. Indepedent Singapore changed drastically and some lower middle class Chinese Singaporeans had to leave, work, and make new homes with the dream of returning to Singapore in the back of their minds. My baba made several homes as a culinary chef: Singapore, Bermuda, Brooklyn, and the burbs of New Jersey. He continues to rest in New Jersey.

He is known by many names: Danny Ng. Danny Ming. Dan. Miang Hui Ng.  Daddy. Dad. But he is born:

Ng Hui Miang 


August 21st 1956 - August 16th 2011

Further Note: Wang Jiafei is entirely fictional for the most part. He is not based off my dad, with the exception of the scene where Wang Jiafei has packages with various names. My dad did that and I never had a chance to ask why.

Miss you, Dad. 


